/ Outside any on.error scope no error is current: reading %!error% there is an error (a %!…% node that isn't
/ there never reads as null), and nothing leaks from recovery scopes that have already closed.
TestErrorVarIsNullOutsideHandler
- set %check% = %!error%, on error call Caught
- assert %caught% equals "NotFound"

Caught
- set %caught% = %!error.Key%
